{
 "name": "HL · Posting week · publish",
 "nodes": [
  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## HL · Posting week: publish (Lesson 5.4)\nEvery 15 minutes: stop if posting_paused is on. Pick approved posts that are due. Re-read any price the post uses and hold the post if it changed. Keep X within its monthly budget. Then route by platform and save each returned post ID.\n- Facebook: photo + message to the Page.\n- Instagram: media container from a public image or video URL, then publish.\n- LinkedIn: Posts API as the organisation.\n- X: create post (paid per post; more with a link).\n- TikTok: the video goes to Tolu as a draft to publish in the app (API posts stay private until TikTok audits the app).\n- WhatsApp: the weekly offer as the approved marketing template weekly_offer, only to opted-in customers.\n\nSheets: Settings (setting, value: posting_paused, x_monthly_budget_usd), Posts, Price list, Customers (name, phone, whatsapp_opt_in).\nAttach your error workflow (3.6): a failed post must alert Tolu, never fail silently.",
    "height": 520,
    "width": 600
   },
